<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait T-bill balance up in May month/month.</title>
<headline>Kuwait T-bill balance up in May month/month.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The outstanding balance of treasury bills issued by Kuwait's Central Bank rose to 1.254 billion dinars at the end of May, 1997 from 1.168 billion the previous month, a Central Bank bulletin said.</p>
<p>The outstanding balance of public debt instruments -- bonds and bills -- fell to 2.420 billion dinars at the end of May from 2.434 billion at the end of April.</p>
<p>The balance of public debt instruments was 2.690 billion dinars in May 1996.</p>
<p>				 Data in million dinars</p>
<p>				May '97		May '96</p>
<p>Bills</p>
<p>  Matured		     201.9		   357.2</p>
<p>  New Issue		   287.7		   354.5</p>
<p>  Balance		   1,254.2		 1,409.3</p>
<p>Bonds</p>
<p>  Matured		     250.0		   258.3</p>
<p>  New Issue		   150.0		   250.0</p>
<p>  Balance		   1,165.4		  1,280.9</p>
<p>Slight discrepancies in figures are due to rounding.</p>
<p>-- Ashraf Fouad, +965 240 8945</p>
</text>
